{%- comment -%}
  Czarny pasek pod naglowkiem z trzema obietnicami naraz.
  Rozni sie od paska ogloszeniowego nad naglowkiem: tamten przewija
  komunikaty po kolei, ten pokazuje wszystkie trzy jednoczesnie,
  wiec klient nie musi czekac az tresc sie zmieni.

  Srodkowe pole jest miejscem na komunikat wyprzedazowy - dlatego
  kazdy element moze miec wlasny kolor tekstu.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign ile = section.blocks.size

  # Na telefonie tyle kolumn, ile hasel zostaje po schowaniu tych z
  # "Hide on phones" - inaczej dwa hasla stoja w miejscach dla trzech i
  # ostatnie wciska sie w srodkowa trzecia czesc, lamiac na dwie linie.
  assign ile_m = 0
  for b in section.blocks
    unless b.settings.hide_m
      assign ile_m = ile_m | plus: 1
    endunless
  endfor
  if ile_m == 0
    assign ile_m = 1
  endif
-%}

{%- if ile > 0 -%}
  <style>
    {%- if section.settings.sticky -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Pasek przykleja sie pod tym, co juz jest przyklejone wyzej -
        pod belka ogloszen i naglowkiem. Odsuniecie od gory liczy
        skrypt, bo obie te wysokosci zmieniaja sie z szerokoscia
        ekranu, a naglowek dodatkowo kurczy sie przy przewijaniu.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 19;
      }
    {%- endif -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub {
      background: {{ section.settings.bg }};
      color: {{ section.settings.fg }};
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__in {
      max-width: {{ section.settings.max_width }}px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: {{ section.settings.pad }}px 16px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ ile }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
      align-items: center;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      gap: 9px;
      min-width: 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: inherit; text-decoration: none;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__ico {
      flex: 0 0 {{ section.settings.icon_size }}px;
      width: {{ section.settings.icon_size }}px;
      height: {{ section.settings.icon_size }}px;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__ico svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__txt {
      font-size: {{ section.settings.size }}px;
      font-weight: {{ section.settings.weight }};
      letter-spacing: {{ section.settings.tracking }}px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      {% if section.settings.caps %}text-transform: uppercase;{% endif %}
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__m { display: none; }
    {%- comment -%}
      Na telefonie trzy pola po jednej trzeciej szerokosci to okolo
      105 px kazde - dlatego mniejszy stopien pisma, wezsze odstepy
      i ikona nad tekstem zamiast obok niego.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    @media screen and (max-width: {{ section.settings.breakpoint }}px) {
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub { {% unless section.settings.show_mobile %}display: none;{% endunless %} }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__in {
        padding: {{ section.settings.pad_m }}px 10px;
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__item {
        {% if section.settings.stack_m %}flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;{% else %}gap: 6px;{% endif %}
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__ico {
        flex: 0 0 {{ section.settings.icon_size_m }}px;
        width: {{ section.settings.icon_size_m }}px;
        height: {{ section.settings.icon_size_m }}px;
      }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__txt {
        font-size: {{ section.settings.size_m }}px;
        letter-spacing: {{ section.settings.tracking_m }}px;
      }
      {%- comment -%}
        Gdy pozycja ma krotszy napis na telefon, dluzszy chowamy.
        Inaczej jeden z trzech napisow lamie sie na dwie linie
        i caly pasek rosnie o wysokosc wiersza, a pozycje przestaja
        stac w jednej linii.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__txt--dwa .ub__d { display: none; }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__txt--dwa .ub__m { display: inline; }
      {%- comment -%}
        Trzy hasla na 375 px dawaly po ok. 105 px na kazde i wymuszaly pismo
        9 px - nieczytelne dla klientki 40-60. Pozycja z zaznaczonym
        "Hide on phones" znika na telefonie, a dwie pozostale maja miejsce
        na czytelny stopien.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__item--bez-tel { display: none; }
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .ub__in { grid-template-columns: repeat({{ ile_m }}, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="ub">
    <div class="ub__in">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- capture srodek -%}
          <span class="ub__ico">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="{{ section.settings.stroke }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              {%- comment -%}
                Rysunek cienka kreska, te same metafory co na wzorcu:
                wozek sklepowy, dwie strzalki w przeciwne strony, dlon
                z moneta, wieszak. Rysowane od zera - pliki wzorca sa
                ich wlasnoscia i nie ma powodu ich kopiowac.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- case block.settings.icon -%}
                {%- when 'cart' -%}<path d="M2.3 4.3h2.5l2.4 9.5h9.2l2.2-7H7.4"/><circle cx="9.4" cy="18.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="16.3" cy="18.5" r="1.5"/>
                {%- when 'swap' -%}<path d="M3 9h16l-3.4-3.4"/><path d="M21 15H5l3.4 3.4"/>
                {%- when 'return' -%}<path d="M8.6 13.6 3.8 8.8l4.8-4.8"/><path d="M3.8 8.8h10.4a5.6 5.6 0 0 1 0 11.2h-2.8"/>
                {%- when 'coin' -%}<circle cx="16.4" cy="6.6" r="3.4"/><path d="M2.6 13.4h3.2l3.5 2.5h4.1a1.45 1.45 0 0 1 0 2.9H9"/><path d="M2.6 13v7h3.2v-7"/>
                {%- when 'hanger' -%}<path d="M12 7.4a2.1 2.1 0 1 1 2.1 2.1c-1.2 0-2.1.9-2.1 2.1"/><path d="m12 11.6 8.5 5.4a1.35 1.35 0 0 1-.7 2.5H4.2a1.35 1.35 0 0 1-.7-2.5L12 11.6Z"/>
                {%- when 'tag' -%}<path d="M3.4 12.6V3.9h8.7l9.2 9.2-8.7 8.7-9.2-9.2Z"/><circle cx="7.8" cy="7.9" r="1.5"/>
                {%- when 'percent' -%}<path d="M6.2 17.8 17.8 6.2"/><circle cx="7.7" cy="7.7" r="2.2"/><circle cx="16.3" cy="16.3" r="2.2"/>
                {%- when 'lock' -%}<rect x="4.8" y="10.6" width="14.4" height="9.2" rx="1.4"/><path d="M8.2 10.6V7.8a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7.6 0v2.8"/>
                {%- when 'clock' -%}<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.6"/><path d="M12 6.8v5.4l3.4 2"/>
                {%- when 'card' -%}<rect x="2.8" y="5.8" width="18.4" height="12.4" rx="2"/><path d="M2.8 10.2h18.4"/>
                {%- when 'chat' -%}<path d="M3.8 4.8h16.4v11.4H9.2l-5.4 4V4.8Z"/><path d="M7.8 9.2h8.4M7.8 12.4h5.2"/>
                {%- else -%}<path d="M2.4 5.9h10.2v10.2H2.4z"/><path d="M12.6 8.9h4.1l3.5 3.5v3.7h-7.6"/><circle cx="6.2" cy="17.6" r="1.9"/><circle cx="16.6" cy="17.6" r="1.9"/>
              {%- endcase -%}
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ub__txt{% if block.settings.text_m != blank %} ub__txt--dwa{% endif %}"{% if block.settings.color != blank %} style="color: {{ block.settings.color }};"{% endif %}>
            <span class="ub__d">{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
            {%- if block.settings.text_m != blank -%}
              <span class="ub__m">{{ block.settings.text_m }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        {%- endcapture -%}

        {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}
          <a class="ub__item{% if block.settings.hide_m %} ub__item--bez-tel{% endif %}" href="{{ block.settings.link }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ srodek }}</a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="ub__item{% if block.settings.hide_m %} ub__item--bez-tel{% endif %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ srodek }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if section.settings.sticky -%}
    <script>
      (function () {
        var pasek = document.getElementById('shopify-section-{{ section.id }}');
        if (!pasek) return;

        function przyklejone() {
          var lista = [];
          var el = pasek.previousElementSibling;
          while (el) {
            if (getComputedStyle(el).position === 'sticky') lista.push(el);
            el = el.previousElementSibling;
          }
          return lista;
        }

        function ustaw() {
          var suma = 0;
          var lista = przyklejone();
          for (var i = 0; i < lista.length; i++) suma += lista[i].offsetHeight;
          pasek.style.top = suma + 'px';
        }

        ustaw();
        window.addEventListener('resize', ustaw);
        document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', ustaw);

        // naglowek kurczy sie po przewinieciu, wiec pilnujemy jego wysokosci
        if (window.ResizeObserver) {
          var obs = new ResizeObserver(ustaw);
          var lista = przyklejone();
          for (var j = 0; j < lista.length; j++) obs.observe(lista[j]);
        }
      })();
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Info bar",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "sn-infobar",
  "enabled_on": { "groups": ["header", "footer"] },
  "max_blocks": 5,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colours" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "bg", "label": "Background", "default": "#000000" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "fg", "label": "Text", "default": "#ffffff" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Text" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "size", "label": "Size", "default": 11, "min": 8, "max": 18, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "weight", "label": "Weight", "default": 600, "min": 400, "max": 800, "step": 100 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "tracking", "label": "Letter spacing", "default": 0.7, "min": 0, "max": 3, "step": 0.1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "caps", "label": "Capital letters", "default": true },

    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "sticky", "label": "Stick to the top when scrolling", "info": "Sits under the announcement bar and the header, if those stick too.", "default": false },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Size" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "pad", "label": "Height", "default": 13, "min": 4, "max": 30, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "icon_size", "label": "Icon", "default": 18, "min": 12, "max": 28, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "stroke", "label": "Icon line", "default": 1.3, "min": 0.8, "max": 2.4, "step": 0.1 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "max_width", "label": "Width of the content", "default": 1500, "min": 800, "max": 1800, "step": 20, "unit": "px" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Mobile" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_mobile", "label": "Show on phones", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "stack_m", "label": "Icon above the text on phones", "info": "Off keeps the bar half as tall, but the texts have to be short.", "default": false },
    { "type": "range", "id": "breakpoint", "label": "Phone below", "default": 750, "min": 480, "max": 1000, "step": 10, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "size_m", "label": "Size", "default": 12, "min": 7, "max": 14, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "tracking_m", "label": "Letter spacing", "default": 0.4, "min": 0, "max": 3, "step": 0.1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "icon_size_m", "label": "Icon", "default": 16, "min": 10, "max": 24, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "pad_m", "label": "Height", "default": 10, "min": 4, "max": 24, "step": 1, "unit": "px" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "item",
      "name": "Item",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select", "id": "icon", "label": "Icon", "default": "truck",
          "options": [
            { "value": "truck", "label": "Delivery van" },
            { "value": "cart", "label": "Shopping trolley" },
            { "value": "return", "label": "Return" },
            { "value": "swap", "label": "Exchange" },
            { "value": "coin", "label": "Hand with a coin" },
            { "value": "hanger", "label": "Clothes hanger" },
            { "value": "tag", "label": "Price tag" },
            { "value": "percent", "label": "Discount" },
            { "value": "clock", "label": "Time" },
            { "value": "lock", "label": "Secure" },
            { "value": "card", "label": "Payment" },
            { "value": "chat", "label": "Support" }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Gratis fragt" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text_m", "label": "Text on phones", "info": "Left empty it uses the text above. Three items share the width, so a long one breaks onto two lines and the whole bar grows." },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "hide_m", "label": "Hide on phones", "info": "With two items left the text on phones can stay readable.", "default": false },
        { "type": "color", "id": "color", "label": "Its own text colour", "info": "Leave it on the bar's colour unless this one item should stand out" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Info bar",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "item", "settings": { "icon": "truck", "text": "Gratis fragt på alle ordrer" } },
        { "type": "item", "settings": { "icon": "tag", "text": "Store besparelser" } },
        { "type": "item", "settings": { "icon": "return", "text": "30 dages returret" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
